---
description: Public SDK — load the viewer, fetch the engine from the CDN
globs: packages/**
alwaysApply: false
---
This repository is the public SDK. It ships the viewer and the framework adapters
and nothing else. Format bundles are private and are loaded at runtime with
`bundlesFromCdn`; do not vendor `.wasm`, fixtures, or engine source here.
Adapters own lifecycle only (`createViewer` / `destroy`). The page forwards raw
browser events and applies events the core emits (`selection`, `zoom`, `need`,
`applied`, `error`, plus paint and embed boxes). It does not hit-test, move
the caret, interpret keys, detect a format, or compute component boxes. The
viewer still does some of that; new code must not add more. On `need`, fetch
that wasm file. Mirror contract changes into `engine-types.ts` in the same
change, and only if you are the contract lane. Follow `docs/SDK_PROMPT.md` and,
when the engine repo is checked out beside this one, one ready lane of
`../wasm/docs/Filedom_Delivery_Workflow.md`. A red lane blocks only lanes
that name it. Do not raise `VISUAL_MAX_DIFF`.
